<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
div {
  width: 200px;
  height: 200px;
  background: linear-gradient(45deg, blue, purple);
  border-radius: 20px;
  border: 4px solid black;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 15px gray;
  transition: all 1s;
}

div:hover {
  width: 350px;
  height: 350px;
  background: linear-gradient(45deg, red, orange, yellow);
  transform: rotate(10deg);
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<h1>Transición con CSS</h1>

<p>Pasa el cursor sobre el cuadro.</p>

<div></div>

</body>
</html>
